# STOCKY / two rooms. Space is time; the lower plot composes ALL written v stages.
# Pinch out strongly expands time; pinch in closes it. + / - also zoom.
# 0, double-click or the bottom 1:1 control fits the whole score.
# Drag / horizontal scroll pans time; F follows the current zoomed window.
# Detach FOLD with its corner arrow or its tab context menu, then Ctrl+F fullscreen.
!t[Ramp rooms]
!vt
intro=({s220v3'10e0 s330v2'10e0}v0>9>0'10)
chorus=({s440v3'10e0 s660v2'10e0}v0>9'10)
intro
;
chorus
# Names come from the calls. No ;intro / ;chorus repetition is necessary.
